  "description": "The .NET base library, returning option and Result instead of null and exceptions. Null-safe strings, dictionary lookups, environment variables, and file IO with a typed error union naming the cases a caller can act on. Culture-explicit parsing lives in Etymon.Core, so a schema does not drag file and environment access into a browser payload to get it.",
